    "description": "A modern Learning Management System (LMS) designed for Arabic language education.\r\nThe platform enables students to access structured courses, interactive lessons, and assessments, while instructors can manage content, track student progress, and communicate effectively.\r\n\r\nKey features include:\r\n\r\nCourse and lesson management\r\nStudent progress tracking\r\nInteractive quizzes and exams\r\nUser-friendly dashboard for students and instructors\r\nSecure authentication and role-based access\r\n\r\nBuilt with a scalable MERN stack architecture (React, Node.js, MongoDB).",
